      "content": "it's not just frustration though. it feels inevitable. like everything i love is being pulled into this void and no matter how hard i try to hold on, my hands just slip. it feels like the universe is just finished with this part of itself. why does it even matter to keep fighting for something that's clearly already dead? it just feels exhausting to be the one left watching the ruins.",
