      "content": "I'm truly sorry to hear that you're feeling this way. It's understandable to feel upset that efforts to find beauty or continue might feel futile right now. But perhaps there's different dignity in resistance too—holding onto what matters in the face of despair. Acceptance doesn't mean all hope is lost; sometimes, holding on can open doors to new beginnings that aren't visible yet. However, your feelings of exhaustion and the desire for peace are valid. If holding on feels too heavy, maybe sharing your thoughts and emotions can still bring a bit of relief. You're not alone, and just sharing can be a step toward finding peace in this darkness.",
